    "preamble": "M/S.Britannia Industries Ltd. vs State Of U.P.Through Food Inspector ... on 6 January, 2025 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Neutral Citation No. - 2025:Ahc-Lko:725 Court No. - 18 Case :- Application U/S 482 No. - 3231 of 2008 Applicant :- M/S.Britannia Industries Ltd.",
    "facts": "Applicant being accused has approached this Court through this application under Section 482 Code of Criminal Procedure seeking quashing of the proceedings of Criminal Compliant No. 1214 of 2007, titled State Vs. Surendra Kumar and others, under Sections 7 and 16 Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 as well as the summoning order dated 2.12.2002 passed by Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate-II, Rae Bareli. Learned counsel for applicant has stated that the proceedings before the trial court have been stayed by the Hon'ble Apex Court, as there was no interim stay order by this Court.",
